77-cf21-4863-95df-c836906f2504?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ad172e28c8a6a41f9d60db88a332129c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cfa1251c/uploads/origins/d297d477-cf21-4863-95df-c836906f2504?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5ae8500ff930b3370e0349fbcbdbcf19 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!\n\nI would like an illustration of my Vtuber, please! I love your style! If possible, I would like to use this on Twitch, Twitter or Youtube, if that is okay.\n\nMy character loves video games even if she is bad at them! She is happy and not very smart! If she doesn't have caffeine, she looks very tired and is very grumpy.\n\nAny pose is fine! Thank you very much !\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1DDoOGORRb-OIjIj-essjzZ7yeMtfgesG/view?usp=drive_link\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1DDoOGORRb-OIjIj-essjzZ7yeMtfgesG/view?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@edanoma_meu/works/70", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/294897fe/uploads/origins/928adea5-0590-4749-9442-90160a15ceec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=047dadda444e3e2c0cb09d1ef8e05789", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/294897fe/uploads/origins/928adea5-0590-4749-9442-90160a15ceec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=047dadda444e3e2c0cb09d1ef8e05789, https://si.imgix.net/294897fe/uploads/origins/928adea5-0590-4749-9442-90160a15ceec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=41e8d12ad0d64284f5e4e2498f5c180b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/294897fe/uploads/origins/928adea5-0590-4749-9442-90160a15ceec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f210c49e2b323783b1af8583c1e849fe 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！私はあなたのアートスタイルが大好きで、私のOC (https://imgur.com/a/UWLsWxC) の絵をリクエストしたいです。\nあなたが好きなように創造的な決定をすることができますが、私は特にこの上の目の描き方が好きです ht